# Uncomment these types if you want even more clean repository. But be careful.
# It can make harm to an existing project source. Read explanations below.
#
# Type library file (binary). In old Delphi versions it should be stored.
# Since Delphi 2009 it is produced from .ridl file and can safely be ignored.
*.tlb
#
# Diagram Portfolio file. Used by the diagram editor up to Delphi 7.
# Uncomment this if you are not using diagrams or use newer Delphi version.
#*.ddp
#
# Visual LiveBindings file. Added in Delphi XE2.
# Uncomment this if you are not using LiveBindings Designer.
#*.vlb
#
# Deployment Manager configuration file for your project. Added in Delphi XE2.
# Uncomment this if it is not mobile development and you do not use remote debug feature.
*.deployproj
#
# C++ object files produced when C/C++ Output file generation is configured.
# Uncomment this if you are not using external objects (zlib library for example).
*.obj
#

# Delphi compiler-generated binaries (safe to delete)
*.exe
*.dll
*.bpl
*.bpi
*.dcp
*.so
*.apk
*.drc
*.map
*.dres
*.rsm
*.tds
*.dcu
*.lib
*.a
*.o
*.ocx

# Delphi autogenerated files (duplicated info)
*.cfg
*.hpp
*Resource.rc

# Delphi local files (user-specific info)
*.local
*.identcache
*.projdata
*.tvsconfig
*.dsk

# Delphi history and backups
__history/
__recovery/
*.~*

# Castalia statistics file (since XE7 Castalia is distributed with Delphi)
*.stat

# Boss dependency manager vendor folder https://github.com/HashLoad/boss
modules/

*.zip
*.rar
Units/

#Db folder. Track version of blank DB it should in DB_Blank/
DB/
__recovery
images/

# Firebird client log written to the working dir on connection errors
firebird.log

# FastMM4 diagnostic memory manager (temporary bad-free hunt, not shipped).
# Sources + the FullDebugMode DLL live in the tree only while chasing the crash.
FastMM4.pas
FastMM4Messages.pas
FastMM4Options.inc
FastMM_FullDebugMode*.dll
*_MemoryManager_EventLog.txt

# Generated at build time by GenerateBuildInfo.ps1 (project pre-build step).
# Not committed: it changes every build, and committing it would make even a
# clean release build stamp a false "+" dirty marker. Fresh checkouts get it
# from the pre-build step before the compiler needs it.
BuildInfo.inc

# Claude Code / AI assistant local files
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Vendor keypair material -- NEVER commit. The secret key lives in an offline
# vault; the public key is embedded in PawnProSetup.exe via SetupVendorPublicKey.inc.
Tools/vendor_public.key
Tools/vendor_secret.key
*.key
plugins.conf

# Runtime log written next to the EXE by the image-backup audit controller.
ImageBackupAudit.log

# Test evidence: real customer item photos, never commit.
Docs/CrashEvidence/T7_originals/

# LeadsOnline API documentation received under NDA -- never commit.
PawnDocs/Private/
